    "Recursive call apne aap base case ki taraf badhega, toh n same rehne se bhi 0 ho jayega.",
    "sd(n) call karta hai, phir woh andar jaake n ko chhota kar dega, isliye 7 aayega.",
    "n % 10 + sd(n) mein recursive call aage badhti hai, toh 25 ka digit 5 aur 2 ka sum 7.",
    "Jab tak n 0 nahi hota, call chalti rehti hai, phir 25 ke digits add karke 7 dega.",
    "Har call mein n ka last digit nikalta hai aur n khud kam ho jata hai, isliye 5+2=7."
  ]
}
